      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm having a nightmare with this vba macro. i keep getting \"run-time error '1004': application-defined or object-defined error\" when i try to run my monthly recon script. \n\nit's super weird because i've checked the sheet names and they are definitely right, and it worked fine last month. now it's just acting up and refusing to paste the data into the report sheet. it's like there's something weird happening behind the scenes that i can't see. can u help me figure out what's causing this?\n\nSub MonthlyRecon()\n    Dim wsSource As Worksheet\n    Dim wsDest As Worksheet\n    Set wsSource = ThisWorkbook.Sheets(\"Data_Input\")\n    Set wsDest = ThisWorkbook.Sheets(\"Recon_Report\")\n    \n    ' trying to copy the data range\n    wsSource.Range(\"A1:G500\").Copy Destination:=wsDest.Range(\"A1\")\n    \n    MsgBox \"Reconciliation Complete\"\nEnd Sub",
